{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51463","headline":"武侯墓 · 张演","name":"武侯墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"动业伊周亚，经纶楚汉前。\n有才真命世，无地与中天。\n大统《春秋》意，誊章《说命篇》。\n吾家子房後，千载英贤。\n（《关中胜蹟图志》二十二《汉中府·古蹟·郊邑》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张演","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}